flowchart TD
  A[/sell] --> B[Apply /vendor/apply]
  B --> C[Wizard + KYC docs]
  C --> D[SUBMITTED]
  D --> E[Admin reviews /admin/vendors]
  E --> F{Approved?}
  F -- No --> G[Reject / changes requested]
  G --> B
  F -- Yes --> H[Vendor ACTIVE + rental trial]
  H --> I[/vendor desk]
  I --> J[Create / bulk import products]
  J --> K{Valid + quota?}
  K -- No --> L[Row errors / report]
  L --> J
  K -- Yes --> M[PENDING_REVIEW or PUBLISHED]
  M --> N[Receive VendorOrder when PAID]
  N --> O[Accept]
  O --> P[Packaged]
  P --> Q[Shipped + tracking]
  Q --> R[Delivered]
  R --> S[Wallet settlement + payout request]
